---
const title = 'Terms of Service - Jumpstart Scaling';
const description = 'Terms of service for Jumpstart Scaling services.';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description}>
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://jumpstartscaling.com/terms" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: #050505;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #FF6B35; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        p { margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ccc; }
        a { color: #FF6B35; text-decoration: none; }
        a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
        .back-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        ul { margin-left: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; color: #ccc; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
        
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> January 6, 2026</p>
        
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using Jumpstart Scaling services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services.</p>
        
        <h2>2. Services Description</h2>
        <p>Jumpstart Scaling provides business scaling consulting services, including but not limited to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Paid acquisition management</li>
            <li>Funnel architecture and design</li>
            <li>CRM automation and transformation</li>
            <li>Data and analytics implementation</li>
            <li>Content and authority building</li>
            <li>Full growth retainer services</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>3. Service Agreements</h2>
        <p>Specific services will be governed by individual service agreements that outline:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Scope of work</li>
            <li>Deliverables and timelines</li>
            <li>Payment terms and pricing</li>
            <li>Performance metrics and KPIs</li>
            <li>Termination clauses</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>4. Payment Terms</h2>
        <p>Unless otherwise specified in your service agreement:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Payments are due according to the agreed-upon schedule</li>
            <li>Late payments may incur additional fees</li>
            <li>Refunds are subject to the terms in your specific service agreement</li>
            <li>All prices are in USD unless otherwise stated</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>5. Client Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>Clients agree to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Provide accurate and complete information</li>
            <li>Grant necessary access to systems and accounts</li>
            <li>Respond to requests in a timely manner</li>
            <li>Maintain confidentiality of sensitive information</li>
            <li>Comply with all applicable laws and regulations</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>Unless otherwise specified:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Jumpstart Scaling retains ownership of methodologies and proprietary processes</li>
            <li>Deliverables created specifically for clients become client property upon full payment</li>
            <li>Clients grant us the right to use case studies and testimonials (with approval)</li>
