        <p>Either party may terminate the agreement:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>As specified in the individual service agreement</li>
            <li>Immediately for material breach of these terms</li>
            <li>With written notice as agreed upon in the service contract</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>10. Dispute Resolution</h2>
