        <h2>12. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>For questions about these Terms of Service, contact us at:</p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> legal@jumpstartscaling.com</p>
        
        <br><br>
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
